Short:        LW: Model of a Newtons Cradle
Author:       ali@ajaybee.demon.co.uk (Alistair Buxton)
Uploader:     ali ajaybee demon co uk (Alistair Buxton)
Type:         pix/3dobj
Architecture: generic

This is a lightwave model of a newtons cradle (thing with swinging balls). The whole
archive should be unpacked to a directory called "Newtons", in Lightwaves' "Objects"
Directory. If you don't do this, the scene files won't work. The included scenes are
scene.(1 to 3), which have all the bits set up in different motions, and scene.pic,
which is the scene used to generate the included sample pic.

